[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00003",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、今日はスカウトに集中だ\r\n町中から……公園の方も回ろう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "012"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あの……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（とにかく足を使うんだ\r\n無駄な時間なんてないぞ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "──あの、すみません",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よしっ！　……え？\r\n……お、俺ですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はい。突然声をかけたりして、すみません\r\n袖のボタンが落ちそうで、気になってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010030",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ？\r\n……あ、本当だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すみません……ありがとうございます\r\n恥ずかしいところを見られちゃって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ふふ、いいえ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なんだろう……この人の笑顔、すごく優しいなぁ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あの……よかったら、私に直させてもらえませんか？\r\n裁縫道具を持ってるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……いやいや！\r\nそんなことまでしてもらうわけには──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "でも、もう落ちちゃいそうですよ……？\r\nどうぞ、ご遠慮なさらず",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010060",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ……\r\nお願いしちゃってもいいですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ええ\r\nちょっと失礼しますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（つ、ついお願いしてしまった……\r\n笑顔に、つられちゃうんだよなあ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はい、できました♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（自然とあったかい気持ちになるというか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ……おおっ、あっという間ですね……！\r\n本当に、なんとお礼を言っていいか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いいえ、お役に立てて良かったです\r\nそれじゃあ、私はこれで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010100",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……ええと……突然すみませんが……\r\nアイドルになってみませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "えっ？\r\nアイドル、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "びっくりされましたよね、すみません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は俺、アイドルのプロデューサーをやっていて\r\n新人アイドルをスカウト中なんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなところで急に、と思われるかもしれませんが……\r\nどうしてもあなたに惹きつけられてしまって！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "え、ええと……そう、なんですね\r\n……でも、ごめんなさい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "私、雑貨屋に勤めているんです\r\n今の仕事が好きですし……そういうのは、ちょっと",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010130",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雑貨屋に……そうですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、その……今の仕事を、辞めなくても構いません\r\nお休みの日に、まずはレッスンだけでも！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いえ……そんな急に……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600101/1016001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "では、お話だけでも！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010150,
